The SDK is organized around one `DaemonClient` instance. You create it once, point it at an animaOS-compatible host, and then work through the typed `agents`, `swarms`, `memories`, and `connectors` sub-clients.

<CardGrid>
  <Card title="Health">
    Verify host reachability with `client.health()` before doing application work.
  </Card>
